{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/716006-lfg-ex3-pbp","id":716006,"title":"LFG Ex3 PbP","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-22T16:02:26-07:00","id":716006,"title":"LFG Ex3 PbP","content":"So now that the backer's Ex3 pdf was finally released: Who wants to play some Exalted? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> For now I plan to host the game on RPOL.net, but that is because I don't know about better options so I am open to suggestions.<br /> The PbP format is mostly given by my RL schedule, but I would like to combine it with some live non-voice chat (IRC/Skype/Hangouts/Jabber/Facebook/...) because from my experience live chat helps to keep the group together.<br /> <br /> The initial plan is to run through some white room scenarios to see how the mechanics work together as we learn them.<br /> The ultimate goal is a Sandbox game so while I want to start with a Solar game, we can mix it up with other types as they come out.<br /> <br /> EDIT: The RPOL thread: <b> <a href=\"http://rpol.net/game.cgi?gi=65020&amp;date=1445559402\" target=\"_blank\">http://rpol.net/game.cgi?gi=65020&amp;date=1445559402 </a></b><br /> It has been some time since my last game on RPOL so I will be a bit rusty with the system.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":744,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/744-korusef","user":"Korusef","date":". 10-23-2015, 12:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/744-korusef","name":"Korusef","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar744_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"510"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T16:24:26-07:00","id":716076,"title":"","content":"Funny enough, I just listed a post in the GMs Wanted forum for Exalted 3E over on RPOL. I'd rather not do white room stuff; a better way to test mechanics is, I think, a short prelude. You can do all kinds of stuff with it. Have destiny draw us together to a village in the threshold overrun by the undead, led by some minor death god. We could save people, use some survival stuff, combat, etc., all within a short span.<br /> <br /> I will be running a game, too, but I'd really like to play as a Zenith or maybe more likely a Twilight sorceress. Also, chat stuff is kind of tough for me, so if that's a dealbreaker, I understand.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T17:09:26-07:00","id":716294,"title":"","content":"It is not a deal breaker, but from my experience the group holds better if there is an informal OOC chat available.<br /> It usually takes me weeks to create full character for a campaign and I don't want to wait that long <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> Hence &quot;white rooms&quot; to just throw stuff around with various character concepts.<br /> It will all depend on how fast and how many people we will be able to gather.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/744-korusef","name":"Korusef","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar744_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"510"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-23T01:25:28-07:00","id":718090,"title":"","content":"I'd be down to play a Dawn, depending on the group and game intentions!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8507-gilgamesh","name":"Gilgamesh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-23T09:17:50-07:00","id":719562,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gilgamesh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/716006-lfg-ex3-pbp?p=718090#post718090\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd be down to play a Dawn, depending on the group and game intentions!</div> </div> </div> </div>Being a Dawn is such a broad statement that it is hardly limiting.<br /> (Also edited the top post with the RPOL thread.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/744-korusef","name":"Korusef","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar744_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"510"}]},"thankedby":[